    (1017, '2025-heavyweight-tote-bag-ss25-hero', '2025 Heavyweight Tote Bag - SS25 Hero', '', 3, 2, 7, 3, 9.99, 'EUR', 0, 1),
    (1018, '2025-fnatic-pro-jersey', '2025 Fnatic Pro Jersey', 'It’s here - the 2025 Pro Kit Jersey, made for Fnatic fans everywhere. Whether you’re in the crowd, watching from home, or out repping Fnatic daily, this jersey delivers style and comfort in equal measure. Sizing Tip: Models are wearing size ''M''. Need help finding your fit? Check out our size guide.', 3, 1, 1, 3, 69.99, 'EUR', 0, 1),
    (1019, 'g2-cs-pro-jersey-2024-black', 'G2 CS Pro Jersey 2024 Black', '100% Polyester', 3, 1, 1, 2, 44.65, 'EUR', 1, 1),
    (1020, 'the-mongolz-pro-jersey-2026-beige', 'The Mongolz Pro Jersey 2026 Beige', 'Represent the absolute powerhouse of Asian Counter-Strike with the official 2026 The MongolZ Pro Jersey. Honoring their historic evolution into Mongolia’s officially designated National Esports Team, this jersey blends aggressive heritage with tactical modern engineering.Designed for peak competitive performance, the 2026 jersey features a sleek, minimalist cream-sand base, flanked by bold matte-charcoal accents and electric blue contour piping that mirrors the swift, razor-sharp execution the team is known for on the global stage.PRODUCT BENEFITS:Pro-Grade Performance Fabric: Cut from ultra-lightweight, moisture-wicking polyester to keep you cool and dry through high-intensity clutch moments.Ergonomic Athletic Fit: Tailored flat-seam construct designed to sit cleanly during long gaming sessions without chaffing or restricting movement.High-Definition Sublimation: The iconic warrior crest logo, sponsor array, and back branding are permanently embedded into the fabric—meaning no peeling, cracking, or fading over time.Elite Detailing: Features the official team motto inscribed across the lower back tail, serving as a reminder of the squad''s legendary resilience: "A man can be destro…', 3, 1, 1, 101, 89.07, 'EUR', 0, 1),
    (1021, 'g2-pro-jersey-2025-black', 'G2 Pro Jersey 2025 Black', 'Every jersey is unique and proudly crafted in Portugal, with a pattern that never repeats - no two are the same. Material:100% Recycled Polyester', 3, 1, 1, 2, 80.23, 'EUR', 0, 1),
    (1022, 'mouz-pro-jersey-2026-black', 'MOUZ Pro Jersey 2026 Black', 'Elevate your game and wear the colors of excellence. The Official MOUZ 2026 Pro Jersey combines high-performance esports aesthetics with a sophisticated, tailored design. Whether you’re competing on the digital battlefield or cheering from the stands of the Lanxess Arena, this jersey is the ultimate way to show your loyalty to the squad. Designed with a sharp polo-style collar, this kit bridges the gap between classic sportswear and modern competitive edge. PRODUCT BENEFITS: Authentic Team Branding: Proudly displays the official MOUZ logo on the chest, complemented by sponsor logos including FONBET and CS. MONEY to mirror the gear worn by the pros during match day. Pro-Comfort Fit: Constructed with a high-quality, breathable fabric designed to keep you cool and focused during high-pressure gaming sessions. Sophisticated Design: Featuring a bold, vibrant red base accented with clean white collar and sleeve trim, offering a clean, professional look that stands out in any crowd. Official Season Gear: The 2026 edition represents the latest iteration of the MOUZ uniform - essential for any dedicated supporter or collector.', 3, 1, 1, 102, 80.23, 'EUR', 0, 1),
    (1023, 'mouz-pro-jersey-2026-red', 'MOUZ Pro Jersey 2026 Red', 'Elevate your game and wear the colors of excellence. The Official MOUZ 2026 Pro Jersey combines high-performance esports aesthetics with a sophisticated, tailored design. Whether you’re competing on the digital battlefield or cheering from the stands of the Lanxess Arena, this jersey is the ultimate way to show your loyalty to the squad. Designed with a sharp polo-style collar, this kit bridges the gap between classic sportswear and modern competitive edge. PRODUCT BENEFITS: Authentic Team Branding: Proudly displays the official MOUZ logo on the chest, complemented by sponsor logos including FONBET and CS. MONEY to mirror the gear worn by the pros during match day. Pro-Comfort Fit: Constructed with a high-quality, breathable fabric designed to keep you cool and focused during high-pressure gaming sessions. Sophisticated Design: Featuring a bold, vibrant red base accented with clean white collar and sleeve trim, offering a clean, professional look that stands out in any crowd. Official Season Gear: The 2026 edition represents the latest iteration of the MOUZ uniform - essential for any dedicated supporter or collector.', 3, 1, 1, 102, 80.23, 'EUR', 0, 1),
    (1024, 'g2-iemrio23-baseball-cap-white', 'G2 Baseball Cap Black', NULL, 3, 1, 5, 2, 26.74, 'EUR', 0, 1),
    (1025, 'navi-pro-jersey-2026-black', 'NAVI Pro Jersey 2026 Black', 'This jersey marks a new start. Bold colors, glitch and digital noise built from the shapes of NAVI trophies - raw energy that turns chaos into wins. A thank-you message on the external tag - for every fan who’s part of this journey. PRODUCT DETAILS: Premium Sublimated Graphics: Say goodbye to peeling or cracking logos. Our advanced sublimation process fuses the ink directly into the fabric fibers. This ensures vibrant colors and razor-sharp details that will never fade, no matter how many times you hit the wash. 100% Performance Polyester: Built with lightweight, ultra-breathable polyester, this jersey is designed to manage moisture and keep you cool during intense overtime rounds. Athletic Fit & Feel: The cuts of the jersey are slightly oversized. Anti-Chafe Construction: Soft-touch flatlock stitching reduces friction against the skin, providing "set it and forget it" comfort for marathon streaming sessions or tournament weekends.', 4, 1, 1, 6, 80.23, 'EUR', 0, 1),
    (1026, 'team-liquid-naruto-sasuke-mousepad-blue', 'Team Liquid Naruto Sasuke Mousepad Blue', 'Against a sea of blue, Sasuke''s red sharingan pierces through! Rep an anime legend and an esports legacy at the same time with his high-quality, durable mouse pad. Smooth cloth surface Sublimated Sasuke line art design Rubberized anti-slip base 3mm Thickness 35" x 16” (89cm x 40.5cm)', 3, 2, 6, 5, 44.65, 'EUR', 0, 1),
    (1027, 'mouz-e7-jacket-2023', 'Mouz E7 Pro Jacket 2023 Red', NULL, 3, 1, 4, 102, 66.98, 'EUR', 0, 1),
    (1028, 'big-keychain-circle-rubber', 'BIG Rubber Keychain', 'This rubberized keychain features the official BIG team branding. PRODUCT BENEFITS: Black molded PVC/rubber base featuring the signature BIG bear paw logo in raised white print at the center. Surrounded by concentric white text reading "BERLIN INTERNATIONAL GAMING" along the bottom and "#GOBIG" on top, framed by subtle red, yellow and black edge accents. Comes with a durable metal ring/carabiner clip attachment for securing keys or bags.', 3, 2, 9, 103, 6.28, 'EUR', 0, 1),
    (1029, 'big-pro-jersey-2024-white', 'BIG Pro Jersey 2024 White', 'Current-season gear is about hype; retro gear is about heritage. Anyone can rep a roster when they''re on top, but pulling out a classic kit shows you’ve been locked in since the beginning. It’s a wearable time capsule of the era that made you fall in love with competitive gaming - proving you know the lore, respect the pioneers and earned your stripes long before the world was watching. PRODUCT BENEFITS: Premium Sublimated Graphics: Say goodbye to peeling or cracking logos. The advanced sublimation process fuses the ink directly into the fabric fibers. This ensures vibrant colors and razor-sharp details that will never fade, no matter how many times you hit the wash. 100% Performance Polyester: Built with lightweight, ultra-breathable polyester, this jersey is designed to manage moisture and keep you cool during intense overtime rounds. Athletic Fit & Feel: Tailored for a sleek, modern silhouette that allows for a full range of motion. Whether you''re flicking for a headshot or adjusting your setup, your jersey won''t hold you back. Anti-Chafe Construction: Soft-touch flatlock stitching reduces friction against the skin, providing "set it and forget it" comfort for marathon streamin…', 3, 1, 1, 103, 53.49, 'EUR', 0, 1),
    (1030, 'vitality-pro-jersey-2026-yellow', 'Vitality Pro Jersey 2026 Black', 'For the 2026 season, the Hive is getting a makeover. Team Vitality is partnering with Fulllife, the leading gameswear brand, to create a jersey that transcends the simple competitive outfit. It''s not just a jersey; it''s the armor of the next generation of champions. This jersey is designed to withstand the stress of LANs and offer absolute comfort for everyday wear; this jersey wicks away heat while offering a premium feel thanks to its exclusive FL NanoMatter™ material, a signature of the brand. PRODUCT BENEFITS: Premium Sublimated Graphics: Say goodbye to peeling or cracking logos. Our advanced sublimation process fuses the ink directly into the fabric fibers. This ensures vibrant colors and razor-sharp details that will never fade, no matter how many times you hit the wash. 100% Performance Polyester: Built with lightweight, ultra-breathable polyester, this jersey is designed to manage moisture and keep you cool during intense overtime rounds. Athletic Fit & Feel: Tailored for a sleek, modern silhouette that allows for a full range of motion. Whether you''re flicking for a headshot or adjusting your setup, your jersey won''t hold you back. Anti-Chafe Construction: Soft-touch flat…', 3, 1, 1, 104, 80.23, 'EUR', 0, 1),
    (1031, 'worlds-2026-long-sleeve', 'Camiseta de manga larga del Mundial 2026', 'En el Mundial 2026, la temática gira en torno a ES NUESTRO MOMENTO. Este torneo es mucho más que la culminación de los esports de LoL: es un momento que compartimos todos y que lleva años gestándose. Rendid homenaje a los esports de LoL en Brooklyn con la camiseta de manga larga oficial del Mundial 2026. Características: 90% poliéster, 10% elastano Diseños sublimados Diseños de silicona térmicos delanteros y traseros Cuello y mangas acanalados Etiqueta tejida Parche del Mundial en el dobladillo delantero Secar solo colgado', 1, 1, null, null, 63.99, 'EUR', 1, 1),
    (1032, 'kda-firestarter-blades-fan-kit', 'Kit de fans oficial de BLADES de K/DA (Fired Up)', 'Presentado en una caja de regalo prémium, el kit de fans oficial de BLADES de K/DA (Fired Up) está repleto de coleccionables de FIRESTARTER. Características: 1 llavero de peluche aleatorio (1/4 de probabilidad por chica). 1 carta oficial del club de fans de BLADES. 4 fotos. 4 insignias coleccionables. 1 cinta colgante. 1 entrada aleatoria (1/4 de probabilidad por chica).', 1, 1, null, null, 31.99, 'EUR', 0, 1),
    (1033, 'kda-firestarter-ahri-zip-hoodie', 'Sudadera con cremallera de Ahri K/DA FIRESTARTER', 'No paséis desapercibidos. La sudadera con cremallera de Ahri K/DA FIRESTARTER representa el estilo deslumbrante de Ahri con brillante pedrería plateada en el pecho y las mangas, rematada con su firma para darle un toque personal. Hecha para atraer la luz y todas las miradas. Características: 440 g/m². 100% algodón de alto gramaje. Gráficos de pedrería por toda la prenda. Firma de Ahri bordada. Cremallera frontal con tirador personalizado. Bolsillo delantero. Etiqueta tejida en la costura lateral.', 1, 1, 3, null, 79.99, 'EUR', 0, 1),
    (1034, 'kda-firestarter-pin-trading-starter-set', 'Conjunto de pines inicial de K/DA FIRESTARTER', 'El conjunto de pines inicial de K/DA FIRESTARTER incluye pines de Ahri, Akali, Evelynn y Kai''Sa de la era FIRED UP, junto con una cinta colgante de K/DA para completar el set. Dimensiones aproximadas (por pin): Ancho: 12 cm. Alto: 22,5 cm. Profundidad: 1 cm.', 1, 2, 9, null, 31.99, 'EUR', 0, 1),
    (1035, 'kda-firestarter-band-tee', 'Camiseta del grupo K/DA FIRESTARTER', 'Las chicas han vuelto y están que arden. La camiseta del grupo K/DA FIRESTARTER pone a Ahri, Akali, Evelynn y Kai''Sa en el centro de todas las miradas, con un diseño en la espalda inspirado en la lista de canciones que incluye temas, iconos y firmas. Hecha para los BLADES que nos han acompañado desde el principio. Aviso: Para evitar teñir vuestras demás prendas, lavadla por separado la primera vez. Características: 180 g/m². 100% algodón. Prenda teñida con pigmentos. Gráficos serigrafiados por delante y por detrás. Etiqueta tejida en el dobladillo. Variación de color única del proceso de teñido.', 1, 1, null, null, 36.99, 'EUR', 0, 1),
    (1036, 'kda-firestarter-xl-mousepad', 'Alfombrilla XL de K/DA FIRESTARTER', 'Es hora de prenderle fuego a todo. Dejad que las chicas suban la temperatura con la alfombrilla XL de K/DA FIRESTARTER. Características: Estampado de licra en tela. Bordes con doble costura antidesgaste. Base de goma antideslizante. Dimensiones aproximadas: Ancho: 79,5 cm. Altura: 27,4 cm.', 1, 2, 6, null, 25.99, 'EUR', 0, 1),
    (1037, 'k-da-popstars-pin-set', 'Pack de pines de K/DA', 'K/DA, el nuevo fenómeno k-pop mundial, lo da todo en su primer single. Que el ritmo no pare con estos nuevos pines esmaltados de edición limitada. Pines incluidos: Akali K/DA (máscara) Akali K/DA (normal) Ahri K/DA Evelynn K/DA Kai''Sa K/DA', 1, 2, 9, null, 20.00, 'EUR', 0, 1),
    (1038, 'k-da-akali-unlocked', 'Figura de Akali K/DA Unlocked', '"You ready for this?" Akali K/DA llega a lo más alto en la línea de figuras Unlocked con el número #009. Esta edición especial incluye una luz ultravioleta con la que saldrán a relucir los toques de neón de Akali al iluminar la figura. Características: Máscara de Akali K/DA Luz ultravioleta (requiere 3 pilas AAA, no incluidas) Toques de neón bajo luz ultravioleta Medidas aproximadas: Fabricada con PVC Altura: 24,4 cm Anchura: 13,8 cm', 1, 3, 11, null, 65.00, 'EUR', 0, 1),
    (1039, 'valorant-logo-hoodie-1', 'Sudadera con capucha PRTCL de VALORANT (unisex)', 'Que sepan con quién estás. Características: Bordado "VLRNT" en el pecho Patrón lateral tecnológico Gráfico en capucha "Defy the limits" Bolsillo frontal Modelo masculino: 189cm, talla L Modelo femenino: 167cm, talla L VLRNT bordado, gráficos serigrafiados 100% algodón', 2, 1, 3, null, 45.00, 'EUR', 0, 1),
    (1040, 'valorant-ignition-hoodie', 'Sudadera con capucha Ignition de VALORANT', 'Volved a lo esencial con el relanzamiento de la sudadera con capucha Ignition de VALORANT. Características: Parche de la ilustración del EP1, Ignition Parche de goma de VALORANT en el dobladillo Bolsillo delantero Diseño serigrafiado personalizado en el lateral Diseño serigrafiado y detalles bordados en la parte trasera En la imagen: La modelo mide 1,72 m y lleva la talla M. El modelo mide 1,90 m y lleva la talla L.', 2, 1, 3, null, 45.00, 'EUR', 0, 1)
